21: - [x] 3.2 Admit four obligations through the typed lifecycle API (requirement → lease → FROZEN → TaskSpec → WorkOrder)
22: - [x] 3.3 Bind each admitted work-set to this round's candidate worktree and base head
23: - [x] 3.4 Read the binding back with a read-only query and take a checkpoint
