25: ## 4. KANBAN / SWARM / GSTACK / OPENSPEC
26: 
27: - [x] 4.1 Create the round board through the native CLI and persist the readback
28: - [x] 4.2 Build the SWARM graph (root + four workers + verifier + synthesizer) in one call
29: - [x] 4.3 Record the named-method route readback and what each route does not confer
30: - [x] 4.4 Record this change proposal
