43: - [x] 6.3 Run the six named affected modules plus the CE and wheel positives
44: - [x] 6.4 Re-run the exact-set oracles (19 schemas + registry, 8 skill directories, 13 CLI commands)
45: - [x] 6.5 Compare the read-only subject's bytes before and after the run
46: - [x] 6.6 Independent officer lane on a different model family re-derives the decisive figures
